					"Puis on ajoute les mètres :",
					"$${{eval:1000*a}} + {{b}} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:1000*a+b}}}$$",
					"${{a}}~\\unit{km} + {{b}}~\\unit{m} = {{eval:1000*a+b}}~\\unit{m}$."
